xr_camera_teleoperation
=======================

This product includes software developed by Unitree Robotics
(https://github.com/unitreerobotics/xr_teleoperate, Apache License 2.0, commit 817fb00; and
https://github.com/unitreerobotics/televuer, MIT, commit 766de45). Full license texts: LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY.

Vendored files (all under xr_camera_teleop/robot/vendor/, each file starts with a header naming its source
file, the upstream commit and the modifications). The upstream repository itself is NOT a dependency any more
(no submodule, no monkey-patching).

  vendor/robot_arm_ik.py             <- teleop/robot_control/robot_arm_ik.py (lines 1-311, G1_29_ArmIK only)
      MODIFIED: meshcat/visualisation removed; assets from the package instead of cwd-relative ../assets; model
      cache in the user cache dir (versioned key) instead of ./g1_29_model_cache.pkl; logging_mp -> logging.
  vendor/robot_arm.py                <- teleop/robot_control/robot_arm.py (G1_29_ArmController, JointIndex enums,
                                        MotorState, DataBuffer, G1_29_LowState)
      MODIFIED: arm velocity limit is a constructor argument (default 3.0 rad/s) and applies in simulation too;
      arm target starts at the current posture (not q=0); stop() for the worker threads; go-home warning.
  vendor/robot_hand_unitree.py       <- teleop/robot_control/robot_hand_unitree.py (lines 1-230, Dex3_1_Controller)
      MODIFIED: control loop is a thread (was a multiprocessing.Process) with set_input() instead of shared
      mp Arrays; initial target = current hand state; stop(); gripper code dropped.
  vendor/hand_retargeting.py         <- teleop/robot_control/hand_retargeting.py (Dex3 branch)
      MODIFIED: Inspire/BrainCo removed; package-relative assets; dex_retargeting imported lazily.
  vendor/weighted_moving_filter.py   <- teleop/utils/weighted_moving_filter.py   (class only)
  vendor/motion_switcher.py          <- teleop/utils/motion_switcher.py          (MotionSwitcher only, lazy SDK import)
  vendor/dds_utils.py                <- teleop/robot_control/dds_utils.py        (logging only)
  vendor/tv_wrapper.py               <- televuer/src/televuer/tv_wrapper.py      (constants, fast_mat_inv, TeleData;
                                        controller fields and the TeleVuer machinery removed)

Copied data files: xr_camera_teleop/assets/g1/ (g1_body29_hand14.urdf/.xml + the meshes they reference) and
xr_camera_teleop/assets/unitree_hand/ (Dex3-1 URDFs, unitree_dex3.yml, meshes), unmodified, from
xr_teleoperate/assets @ 817fb00.

Original code of this repository built on top of them: xr_camera_teleop/robot/ik.py (SafeG1_29_ArmIK: self-collision
constraints, mesh gate, branch escape, joint-space home), robot/node.py, robot/watchdog.py, protocol.py, operator/*.
